FastFlowLM (https://github.com/ROCm/FastFlowLM)
  Copyright (c) 2026 Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.
  License: MIT (code). The engine's NPU route reads FastFlowLM's Q4NX model format,
  and Lemonade's onebit recipe downloads FastFlowLM's models from Hugging Face
  (FastFlowLM/*-NPU2; the weights keep their own licenses, e.g. Qwen's Apache-2.0).
